            }
          },
          "write": false,
          "notes": "Same slots and padding as dofJointPath. Values are PxArticulationJointType: 1 prismatic, 2 revolute, 3 revolute unwrapped, 4 spherical. Fixed joints are 0 and have no DOF row, so a 0 inside dofCount is not a type; only entries past dofCount are padding. For unique joint leaf names, the legacy DOF name is the leaf of dofJointPath, plus ':' and dofAxisKind, only when this value is spherical. Legacy names disambiguate colliding joint leaves with numeric suffixes; full prim paths remain the identity."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
