              ],
              "count": "linkCount",
              "padding": 0
            }
          },
          "write": false,
          "notes": "Slot L is the link index PxArticulationLink::getLinkIndex() returns. 0 pads past linkCount. Slot 0 is the root link. The articulation row prim carries PhysicsArticulationRootAPI and may be the root link, an ancestor Xform, or a fixed joint that is a child of slot 0. Fixed base: link 0 has no Jacobian rows; link L > 0 occupies rows 6*(L-1) through 6*L-1. Floating base: link L occupies rows 6*L through 6*L+5. An ARTICULATION_LINK query is not guaranteed to be in this order."
        }
      ]
    },
