          },
          "write": false,
          "notes": "Slot L is the interned prim of the joint PxArticulationLink::getInboundJoint() returns for linkPath slot L. 0 inside linkCount means that link has no inbound joint; slot 0 is 0 because the root link has none. 0 past linkCount is padding. A fixed joint between two links is included. dofJointPath skips zero-DOF joints, so it is not this map. The world fixed joint that carries PhysicsArticulationRootAPI is the articulation row prim, not slot 0."
        }
      ]
